break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方公演も後半戦に突入です〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日は真夏の全国ツアー2025宮城公演1日目！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は初めての宮城！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"到着して牛タンを食べました！\nめっちゃ美味しかったぁ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べる前、うきうきしてる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202508/mobgcabGo.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ雨でしたね…。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん大丈夫でしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひかないでね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの声援とサイリウムの中で夢のような時間でした！\n本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日からまた皆さんにお会いできること\nめっちゃ楽しみにしていたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかやっと会えた感じがする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだろう、よくわかんないけど遠距離っぽい感じ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく嬉しかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月も皆さんと楽しい夏の思い出を増やしていきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"精一杯頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"過ぎていく時間は戻ってこないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"今\"を大切に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月も一緒に夏を楽しみましょう〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"